---
import MainLayout from "../../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout title="NexGen Winners Surprise | Justin Ho">
  <a href="/portfolio" class="back-link">← Back to Portfolio</a>

  <section class="project-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Shooting & Editing</p>
    <h1>NexGen Winners Surprise</h1>
    <p class="client">Client: AAMS</p>
  </section>


<section class="video-section">
  <iframe
    src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1084512624"
    frameborder="0"
    allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture"
    allowfullscreen>
  </iframe>
</section>

  <section class="project-details">
    <h2>Project Overview</h2>
    <p>
      NexGen Winners Surprise was produced for the Association of Advertising and
      Marketing Singapore (AAMS) to document the announcement of the NexGen Award
      winners.
    </p>

    <p>
      The project followed a panel of judges as they travelled across Singapore
      to visit the agencies of the top three winners. Unaware that they had been
      selected, the recipients were surprised in person by the judges, creating
      a series of genuine and unscripted moments.
    </p>

    <p>
      To provide context for each reveal, the judges shared their thoughts on
      camera, discussing the winning work and the qualities that distinguished
      each recipient. These reflections were interwoven with the surprise visits,
      allowing viewers to experience both the evaluation process and the
      emotional reactions of the winners.
    </p>

    <p>
      Beyond documenting the events, my role involved identifying the narrative
      threads that connected each stop on the journey. In the edit, I shaped the
      judges' commentary, travel sequences and winner reactions into a cohesive
      story that balanced information with authentic emotional moments.
    </p>

    <p>
      The result was a documentary-style film that celebrated emerging creative
      talent while capturing the excitement, spontaneity and human stories behind
      the award announcements.
    </p>

<h2>Role</h2>

<ul>
  <li>Videography</li>
  <li>Documentary Coverage</li>
  <li>Story Development</li>
  <li>Narrative Structuring</li>
  <li>Video Editing</li>
  <li>Post-Production Finishing</li>
</ul>
  </section>
</MainLayout>

<style>
  .back-link {
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .project-hero {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 64px 0 40px;
  }

  .eyebrow,
  .client {
    color: var(--muted);
  }

    h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 7vw, 5.5rem);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin: 16px 0;
    }

  .hero-image {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 56px;
  }

  .project-details {
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .video-section {
  margin-bottom: 56px;
}

.video-section iframe {
  width: 100%;
  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
  border: 0;
  border-radius: 16px;
}
</style>